[2026-10-26T20:42:19.594Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"I found two causes in the solver: it scores center lines but ignores markers and stroke thickness, and its gap candidates skip values near the supplied 0.18 arrangement. The arrow mismatch comes from the sharp stroke join extending beyond the path endpoint; acute angles also exceed SVG’s default miter limit. I’ll make scoring account for the painted geometry and add arrow length compensation with a legacy opt-out."}}
