[2026-10-26T20:59:34.711Z] [STDERR] +# Issue 25: automatic spacing, pointed arrows and per-link cards
[2026-10-26T20:59:34.716Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-26T20:59:34.718Z] [STDERR] +Issue: [#25](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/issues/25). Implementation:
