[2026-10-26T20:59:35.452Z] [STDERR] +## Reproducing the investigation
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.454Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.457Z] [STDERR] +After `npm ci` and `npx playwright install chromium firefox webkit`:
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.461Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.464Z] [STDERR] +```sh
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.468Z] [STDERR] +# Intentionally fails the new regressions against the original source, restores edits.
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.472Z] [STDERR] +node experiments/issue-25-reproduce.mjs
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.480Z] [STDERR] +# Numeric choices and exact before/after scores.
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.485Z] [STDERR] +node experiments/issue-25-solver.mjs
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.487Z] [STDERR] +# Actual production browser, pixels, screenshots and share/reload checks.
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.491Z] [STDERR] +npm run build
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.495Z] [STDERR] +npm run test:network:issue25
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.498Z] [STDERR] +ENGINE=firefox npm run test:network:issue25
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.501Z] [STDERR] +ENGINE=webkit npm run test:network:issue25
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.504Z] [STDERR] +```
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.505Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.507Z] [STDERR] +The reproduction script temporarily replaces tracked modified source files;
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.509Z] [STDERR] +run it with no other tests/builds using those files. It preserves current
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.513Z] [STDERR] +contents in memory and restores them even after expected test failures.
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.514Z] [STDERR] +Browser experiments close both browser and preview server in `finally`.
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.516Z] [STDERR] +Fixtures, loop counts, solver ranges and action timeouts are finite. No
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.520Z] [STDERR] +unbounded stack/memory stress is required. On CI the existing 15-minute browser
[2026-10-26T20:59:35.523Z] [STDERR] +job bound and preserved artifacts also cover the new suite.
